ere is no ancestor, see https://github.com/yewstack/yew/compare/master...liquidblock:set-class-name?expand=1#diff-5925cef252f837778e2d2be90760083fR217.\r\n\r\nE.g. The following view\r\n```rust\r\nhtml! {\r\n    <div>{ \"Example\" }</div>\r\n}\r\n```\r\nresults in (as of version 0.14.3):\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/7364785/79486813-890aa200-8017-11ea-8142-8720e07573ab.png)\r\n\r\nFixes: https://github.com/yewstack/yew/issues/936","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yewstack/yew/issues/1085/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yewstack/yew/issues/1085/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]